---
---

<section id="home" class="hero">
  <div class="hero-grid-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-main">
      <p class="hero-kicker">
        <span class="hero-kicker-dot"></span>
        Auditoría de sistemas de pago — Medellín, Colombia
      </p>

      <h1 class="hero-name">David López</h1>

      <p class="hero-headline">
        El bug que no viste en tu integración de pagos te va a costar plata.
      </p>

      <p class="hero-tagline">
        Auditoría de 24 horas para founders y devs en LATAM con pagos en producción. 
        Reviso webhooks, firmas, idempotencia, dobles cobros y race conditions antes de que te cuesten un cliente.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="#offer" class="btn btn-primary">
          <span>Auditoría 24h — $150k COP</span>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
            <path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-secondary">Ver casos reales</a>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-proof">
        <div class="proof-item">
          <span class="proof-icon">✓</span>
          <div>
            <p class="proof-title">Caso real esta semana</p>
            <p class="proof-text">Webhook de Wompi Payouts rechazaba notificaciones reales con 401</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="/blog/webhook-payouts-wompi-firma-invalida" class="proof-link">
          Leer el caso completo →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="hero-risks">
      <div class="risk-card">
        <h3 class="risk-title">Riesgos que reviso</h3>
        <ul class="risk-list">
          <li>
            <span class="risk-icon">⚠</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Firma de webhook</strong>
              <p>Que nadie pueda forjar un webhook y tu sistema lo trate como pago real</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="risk-icon">⚠</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Idempotencia</strong>
              <p>Que un reintento de red no duplique (o borre) una transacción</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="risk-icon">⚠</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Race conditions</strong>
              <p>Que dos órdenes simultáneas no rompan tu libro de cuentas</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="risk-icon">⚠</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Montos y decimales</strong>
              <p>Que no le cobres a un cliente 100× de más — o de menos</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-ticker" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="hero-ticker-track">
      <span>WOMPI</span><span class="sep">/</span>
      <span>BANCOLOMBIA</span><span class="sep">/</span>
      <span>TRUORA</span><span class="sep">/</span>
      <span>CLOUDFLARE WORKERS</span><span class="sep">/</span>
      <span>TYPESCRIPT</span><span class="sep">/</span>
      <span>PYTHON</span><span class="sep">/</span>
      <span>WOMPI</span><span class="sep">/</span>
      <span>BANCOLOMBIA</span><span class="sep">/</span>
      <span>TRUORA</span><span class="sep">/</span>
      <span>CLOUDFLARE WORKERS</span><span class="sep">/</span>
      <span>TYPESCRIPT</span><span class="sep">/</span>
      <span>PYTHON</span><span class="sep">/</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding-top: 90px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-grid-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(var(--border) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, var(--border) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 64px 64px;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black, transparent 85%);
    opacity: 0.35;
  }

  .hero-content {
    max-width: 1240px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2.5rem 5% 3rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .hero-main {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--muted);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .hero-kicker-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    background: var(--success);
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--success-glow);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .hero-name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 6vw, 4.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .hero-name::after {
    content: '.';
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .hero-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 1.65rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.35;
    max-width: 540px;
  }

  .hero-tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 540px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .hero-cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .hero-proof {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .proof-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .proof-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--success-glow);
    border: 1px solid rgba(127, 154, 106, 0.4);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    color: var(--success);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .proof-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .proof-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .proof-link {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .proof-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent-light);
  }

  /* Panel de riesgos */
  .hero-risks {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  }

  .risk-card {
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .risk-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .risk-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .risk-list li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .risk-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--danger-glow);
    border: 1px solid rgba(180, 84, 63, 0.4);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    color: var(--danger);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .risk-list strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .risk-list p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Ticker de integraciones */
  .hero-ticker {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 0.85rem 0;
  }

  .hero-ticker-track {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    width: max-content;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--muted-dim);
    animation: hero-ticker-scroll 32s linear infinite;
  }

  .hero-ticker-track .sep {
    color: var(--border-strong);
  }

  @keyframes hero-ticker-scroll {
    from { transform: translateX(0); }
    to { transform: translateX(-50%); }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero-ticker-track { animation: none; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .hero-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .hero-main {
      padding-top: 0;
    }

    .hero-risks {
      max-width: 600px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero-cta {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>

